 <h3><u>MAI HUSSAIN IBNE ALI HOON</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p><span grande,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif; font-size:12.727272033691406px>Bayat ka sawal aaya jo paish-e-SHAH-E-DILGEER(a.s.)</span><br> <span grande,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif; font-size:12.727272033691406px>nazdeek huwi khuwab say jab khuwab ki ta'abeer</span><br> <span grande,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif; font-size:12.727272033691406px>lagnay lagin jab daao peh kul NABIYON(a.s.) Ki tauqeer</span><br> <span grande,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif; font-size:12.727272033691406px>Bolay najis-e-dehar(l.a.) say yoo'n HAZRAT-E-SH</span><span grande,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif; font-size:12.727272033691406px>ABBIR(a.s.)<br> Gharat kabhi TOHEED-O-RISALAT na karay ga<br> Mujh jaisa teray jaisay ki BAYAT na karay ga<br> <br> Mujh jaisa teray jaisay ki BAYAT na karay ga<br> Tu Yazeed-e-Azali(l.a.) hai MAIN HUSSAIN(a.s.) IBN-E-ALI(a.s.) HOO'N<br> <br> Tu(l.a.) Kon Hai MAIN(a.s.) Kon Hoo'n sun aaey sitam afgaar<br> Tu(l.a.) deen ka munkir hai MAIN(a.s.) Islam ki dastaar<br> Tu(l.a.) Khaak ka putla hai to MAIN(a.s.) Markaz-e-Anwaar<br> Tu(l.a) Bhool anasir ki hai main Khalq ka shahkaar<br> Gum kardah nasab Tu(l.a.) hai to MAIN(a.s.) Raah-e-Khabar Hoo'n<br> Marjana(l.a.) ki Tu(l.a.) bhool MAIN(a.s.) ZEHRA(s.a.) Ka Pisar hoo'n<br> <br> Mujh jaisa teray jaisay ki BAYAT na karay ga<br> Tu Yazeed-e-Azali(l.a.) hai MAIN HUSSAIN(a.s.) IBN-E-ALI(a.s.) HOO'N<br> <br> Tu(l.a.) Shaam ki Tareeki hai main Noor-e-Mubee'n Hoo'n&nbsp;<br> Tu(l.a.) Sang-e-Saqeefa hai main Ka'abay ka Nagee'n Hoo'n<br> Tu(l.a.) Takht peh baitha hai to Main(a.s.) Arsh Nashee'n Hoo'n<br> Shaitaa'n(l.a.) Ka Maka'n Tu(l.a.) Hai MAIN(a.s.) Jannat Ka Makee'n Hoo'n<br> Tu(l.a.) Rijz sarapa hai Main Khaliq ka wali Hoo'n<br> Tu(l.a.) Nasl-e-Umaiyya(l.a.), MAIN HUSSAIN(a.s.) IBN-E-ALI(a.s.) Hoo'n<br> <br> Mujh jaisa teray jaisay ki BAYAT na karay ga<br> Tu Yazeed-e-Azali(l.a.) hai MAIN HUSSAIN(a.s.) IBN-E-ALI(a.s.) HOO'N<br> <br> MAIN(a.s.) Aala tu(l.a.) Kamzaat hai ye baat samajh lay<br> MAIN(a.s.) Fatha hoo'n tu(l.a.) maat hai ye baat samajh lay<br> Yeh Baat alag baat hai yeh baat samajh lay<br> MAIN(a.s.) din hoo'n to tu(l.a.) raat hai yeh baat samajh lay<br> Yeh Baat samajh lay ke MAIN(a.s.) TOHEED Ki Jaa'n Hoo'n<br> Tu(l.a.) Rizq jahannum ka MAIN(a.s.) Sardaar-e-Jinaa'n Hoo'n<br> <br> Mujh jaisa teray jaisay ki BAYAT na karay ga<br> Tu Yazeed-e-Azali(l.a.) hai MAIN HUSSAIN(a.s.) IBN-E-ALI(a.s.) HOO'N<br> <br> Hai tera najis jism to shaitaan(l.a.) ki soorat<br> Paikar hai Mera SOORA-E-REHMAN Ki Soorat<br> Tu(l.a.) Paida huwa hai abu sufiyaan(l.a.) Ki soorat<br> Utra Hoo'n MOHAMMAD(s.a.w.w.) Peh MAIN(a.s.) QURA'AN ki Soorat<br> Sab log NABOOAT Ka samar kehtay hain mujh ko<br> Tu(l.a.) jehl hai aur Ilm ka Dar kehtay hain Mujh ko<br> <br> Mujh jaisa teray jaisay ki BAYAT na karay ga<br> Tu Yazeed-e-Azali(l.a.) hai MAIN HUSSAIN(a.s.) IBN-E-ALI(a.s.) HOO'N<br> <br> Tu(l.a.) jis mein pala woh abu sufiyaan(l.a.) ka ghar hai<br> MAIN(a.s.) jis mein raha HAZRAT-E-IMRAN(a.s.) Ka Ghar hai<br> Jo ghar hai tera asl mein shaitaan(l.a.) ka ghar hai<br> Ghar mera MOHAMMAD(s.a.w.w.) Ka hai QURAAN Ka Ghar hai<br> Tatheer nay paai hai Taharat meray Ghar mein<br> Har lamha barasti rahi la'anat teray ghar mein<br> <br> Mujh jaisa teray jaisay ki BAYAT na karay ga<br> Tu Yazeed-e-Azali(l.a.) hai MAIN HUSSAIN(a.s.) IBN-E-ALI(a.s.) HOO'N<br> <br> Kia deen ki khidmaat teray haath mein day doo'n<br> Islam ki har baat teray haath mein day doo'n<br> QURAAN Ki aayat teray haath mein day doo'n<br> Tu(l.a.) kehta hai MAIN(a.s.) Haath teray haath mein day doo'n<br> Ilzaam-e-Saqeefa hai teri zaat kay upar<br> Kul NABIYO'N Ka hai Haath meray haath kay oopar<br> <br> Mujh jaisa teray jaisay ki BAYAT na karay ga<br> Tu Yazeed-e-Azali(l.a.) hai MAIN HUSSAIN(a.s.) IBN-E-ALI(a.s.) HOO'N<br> <br> Mumkin hi nahin khuwab ki ta'abeer say bayat<br> Tareeki Talab karti hai tanweer say bayat<br> Tu(l.a.) Maangta hai kaatib-e-taqdeer say bayat<br> Hadd hai keh talab karta hai SHABBIR(a.s.) Say bayat<br> Rakh yaad ke daaman tera khaali hi rahay ga<br> Tu(l.a.) maangnay waala hai sawali hi rahay ga<br> <br> Mujh jaisa teray jaisay ki BAYAT na karay ga<br> Tu Yazeed-e-Azali(l.a.) hai MAIN HUSSAIN(a.s.) IBN-E-ALI(a.s.) HOO'N<br> <br> Kar ghor zara Aala Nasab tu(l.a.) hai ke MAIN(a.s.) Hoo'N<br> Kar ghor zara Shaan-e-Adab tu(l.a.) hai ke MAIN(a.s.) Hoo'N<br> Kar ghor zara Fakhr-e-Arab tu(l.a.) hai ke MAIN(a.s.) Hoo'N<br> Yeh Soch ke Khilqat ka sabab tu(l.a.) hai ke MAIN(a.s.) Hoo'N<br> Khaliq ka jo maqsood-e-Nazar MAIN(a.s.) Nahi'n Hota<br> Duniya hi nahin hoti agar MAIN(a.s.) Nahi'n hota<br> <br> Mujh jaisa teray jaisay ki BAYAT na karay ga<br> Tu Yazeed-e-Azali(l.a.) hai MAIN HUSSAIN(a.s.) IBN-E-ALI(a.s.) HOO'N<br> <br> Hai Noor ALI Noor ki tanweer ka Khutba<br> QURAAN kay Honto'n peh hai Tafseer ka Khutba<br> Farhan ALI, HAZRAT-E-SHABBIR(a.s.) ka Khutba<br> Taqdeer peh hai Katib-e-Taqdeer ka Khutba<br> Sabit huwa baatil ki himayat nahi'n karta<br> Jo RABB(j.j.) Ka numaindah ho bayat nahi'n karta<br> <br> Mujh jaisa teray jaisay ki BAYAT na karay ga<br> Tu Yazeed-e-Azali(l.a.) hai MAIN HUSSAIN(a.s.) IBN-E-ALI(a.s.) HOO'N</span></p> 
